{
    "title": "Doll PlayGround",
    "description": "Unleash Your Creativity and Destruction in Doll Playground: The Ultimate Sandbox Playground!\r\n\r\nReady to unleash your inner mad scientist and create mind-blowing contraptions? Then look no further than Doll Playground, the ultimate sandbox playground where creativity and destruction collide!\r\n\r\nLike other Ragdoll Mutilate games, Doll Playground also has the following features:\r\n\r\nBuild Crazy Machines and Experiment with Explosive Devices:\r\n- Let your imagination run wild as you design and construct elaborate contraptions, from simple machines to complex devices that can crush, impale, or blast ragdolls into oblivion.\r\n- Explore a vast array of materials and gadgets, each with unique physical properties, offering endless creative possibilities.\r\n- Experiment without limits - there are no rules in this sandbox world! Push the boundaries of physics and have a blast with the wacky results.\r\n\r\nDoll Playground - Where Explosive Entertainment Meets Creative Freedom:\r\n- Vibrant graphics and playful animations bring your gaming experience to life with stunning visuals and engaging interactions.\r\n- Realistic physics simulations accurately mimic the movement and impact of objects, creating jaw-dropping collisions and exhilarating moments.\r\n- Immersive sound effects heighten the excitement and amplify the thrill of every action, keeping you fully engaged in the game.\r\n\r\nDownload Doll Playground today and dive into an explosive world of creativity and entertainment.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Unleash Your Creativity and Destruction in Doll Playground: The Ultimate Sandbox Playground!<br><br>Ready to unleash your inner mad scientist and create mind-blowing contraptions? Then look no further than Doll Playground, the ultimate sandbox playground where creativity and destruction collide!<br><br>Like other Ragdoll Mutilate games, Doll Playground also has the following features:<br><br>Build Crazy Machines and Experiment with Explosive Devices:<br>- Let your imagination run wild as you design and construct elaborate contraptions, from simple machines to complex devices that can crush, impale, or blast ragdolls into oblivion.<br>- Explore a vast array of materials and gadgets, each with unique physical properties, offering endless creative possibilities.<br>- Experiment without limits - there are no rules in this sandbox world! Push the boundaries of physics and have a blast with the wacky results.<br><br>Doll Playground - Where Explosive Entertainment Meets Creative Freedom:<br>- Vibrant graphics and playful animations bring your gaming experience to life with stunning visuals and engaging interactions.<br>- Realistic physics simulations accurately mimic the movement and impact of objects, creating jaw-dropping collisions and exhilarating moments.<br>- Immersive sound effects heighten the excitement and amplify the thrill of every action, keeping you fully engaged in the game.<br><br>Download Doll Playground today and dive into an explosive world of creativity and entertainment.",
